WEBVTT

00:02:28.324 --> 00:02:31.690
mamilioni ambao wamefuzu elimu ya juu

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:33.506
mamilioni wanaotaka kusoma

00:02:33.506 --> 00:02:37.367
bali hawawezi wakapata kwa sababu tofauti.

00:02:37.367 --> 00:02:40.412
Kwanza, za fedha.

00:02:40.412 --> 00:02:43.331
Vyuo vikuu ni ghali. sote twajua

00:02:43.331 --> 00:02:45.459
Maeneo kubwa ulimwenguni

00:02:45.459 --> 00:02:47.827
elimu ya juu haiwezekani

00:02:47.827 --> 00:02:50.283
kwa raia wa kawaida.

00:02:50.283 --> 00:02:52.175
Hii ndio pengine shida kubwa

00:02:52.175 --> 00:02:54.704
inayokumba jamii yetu

00:02:54.704 --> 00:02:58.282
elimu ya juu ilikoma kuwa haki kwa wote

00:02:58.282 --> 00:03:01.971
ikawa teule kwa wachache.